"""
Configuration and control GUI for parsec-for-linux.
Handles:
  1. Real-time control of the daemons (start / stop / restart / systemd) and telemetry.
  2. Parsec host configuration (AppData/Roaming/Parsec/config.json and hotkey.json).
  3. Linux bridge configuration (runtime/config.env: capture, VA-API/AMF encoding,
     uinput input, clipboard, PipeWire audio, Wine/DXVK).
  4. Live view of the logs (Parsec, plh-bridge, Wine, input-hook, clipd).
"""
